flowchart LR
  %% Figure 2.5: Text-only processing workflow
  input["Text message"]
  validate["Pydantic request validation"]
  state["HSR metadata: invalid / text_only"]
  bypass["No audio features or HSE inference"]
  fusion["StateFusion handles unmeasured input"]
  policy["Rule-based dialogue policy"]
  memory["Conversation memory + prompt"]
  llm["Configured LLM provider"]
  persist["Persist successful conversation turn"]
  out["JSON response to client"]
  input -->|POST /api/v1/message| validate
  validate -->|valid message| state
  state -->|observation_valid=false| bypass
  bypass -->|text and conversation context| fusion
  fusion -->|neutral internal defaults| policy
  policy -->|selected strategy| memory
  memory -->|prompt| llm
  llm -->|success only| persist
  persist -->|response| out
